  "preamble": "Denasalization and lowering of the nasalized close-mid front vowel [ẽ] to the open front unrounded vowel [a]. This shift involves loss of nasality through denasalization and simultaneous lowering of vowel height, documented in East Slavic, where Proto-Slavic *ę became [ʲa].",
